# Cat Collector: the Cat is for the first life gain "during each of your turns" (CR 603.2). Bot1 casts the Collector on turn 1
# (Food token and no Cat) and, on Bot2's turn 2, gains 3 life with Healing Salve: no Cat, it is not Bot1's turn. On turn 3 a
# Salve that gains life for Bot2, not for Bot1, makes no Cat and does not use up the "first time" (positive control), and the
# next Salve, which gains Bot1's life for the first time this turn, makes the Cat: one Cat token for the three gains.

